            <ArticleTitle>[Use of drinking mineral waters in children with bronchial asthma and associated biliary tract diseases].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>23-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>It is shown that supplementation of therapy of bronchial asthma in children by mineral water (Essentuki No 4) has marked beneficial effect on the functional activity of digestive organs and the respiratory system. It is recommended that drinking mineral waters be included in the course of the resort-and-spa treatment of such patients.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
